OL,3,GNEWSARhun ap Iorwerth at First
OL,4,AMinister's Questions after agreeing
OL,5,Abudget deal with Labour
OL,6,
OL,7,FRhun ap Iorwerth faced opposition
OL,8,Fleaders and Senedd members in the Welsh
OL,9,FParliament
OL,11,FThe session came hours after the Welsh
OL,12,Fgovernment announced it had struck a
OL,13,Fdeal with Labour over its mini-budget
OL,15,FThe government last week also announced
OL,16,Fit would look into closing part of the
OL,17,FM4 to help ease congestion, and would
OL,18,Flook into a new Menai crossing in north
OL,19,FWales
