OL,3,GNEWSARhun ap Iorwerth at First
OL,4,AMinister's Questions after agreeing
OL,5,Abudget deal with Labour
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform leader Helen Jenner said closing
OL,8,Fjunctions would not "make the traffic
OL,9,Fdisappear, it simply moves the problem
OL,10,Felsewhere"
OL,12,FTory Senedd leader Darren Millar
OL,13,Fcriticised public sector pay, saying if
OL,14,Fit was performance-based the government
OL,15,Fwould "all be skint"
